I thought we could swap places.

00:20:54.926 --> 00:20:56.841
You don't know
what it's like here!

00:20:56.885 --> 00:20:58.843
It's so stressful!
It's so epic!

00:20:58.887 --> 00:21:00.584
It's all,
"Tow this space station,"

00:21:00.628 --> 00:21:02.238
and, "Calibrate
the Dyson sphere!"

00:21:02.282 --> 00:21:04.980
"Go back in time and kill theguy that was worse than Hitler!"

00:21:05.023 --> 00:21:07.112
I just want to be back
on a smaller ship,

00:21:07.156 --> 00:21:08.723
doing simpler work.

00:21:08.766 --> 00:21:11.378
I don't want
to be epic anymore!

00:21:11.421 --> 00:21:14.685
Geez, working on
the Vancouverscrews you up.

00:21:14.729 --> 00:21:16.426
I'm sorry I phasered you.

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:18.907
This is not
Ron Emmanuel Docent, Jr.

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:21.083
Can we just keep this
between us?

00:21:21.126 --> 00:21:23.999
You'll delete
the transfer order?

00:21:24.042 --> 00:21:25.566
There. Done.

00:21:25.609 --> 00:21:28.395
And, um, throw in a T88
for each of us.

00:21:28.438 --> 00:21:30.397
Hey, now, that I can't do.

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:32.399
Oh, that's cool. It wasn't
like I was using my implant

00:21:32.442 --> 00:21:34.792
to record all this as evidence
for your court-martial.

00:21:34.836 --> 00:21:36.751
I was.

00:21:36.794 --> 00:21:39.754
Okay, a couple of T88s
coming right up.

00:21:47.892 --> 00:21:49.154
Ooh! Ugh!

00:21:49.198 --> 00:21:50.982
It's squishy!
Give me a hand!

00:21:51.026 --> 00:21:52.680
Oh, my God!

00:21:52.723 --> 00:21:55.596
Stop! Don't! Lover! Lover!

00:21:55.639 --> 00:21:58.076
Lover! Lover!
Lover! Lover! Lover!

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.121
Oh, God.

00:21:59.164 --> 00:22:00.731
Aah! What the hell was that?

00:22:00.775 --> 00:22:02.907
It was always me, Barb.

00:22:02.951 --> 00:22:04.474
I'm going to treat you
to dinner.

00:22:04.518 --> 00:22:06.128
Let me out! Let me out!

00:22:06.171 --> 00:22:08.043
Hmm, apparently,
this species reproduces

00:22:08.086 --> 00:22:10.611
by making their host
chemically irresistible

00:22:10.654 --> 00:22:11.960
to potential mates.

00:22:12.003 --> 00:22:13.570
So Boimler must have
picked it up...

00:22:13.614 --> 00:22:15.224
Right before he met me, exactly.

00:22:15.267 --> 00:22:17.139
Wait. Wait.

00:22:17.182 --> 00:22:19.620
So are you saying you only likedme because of the parasite?

00:22:19.663 --> 00:22:21.448
Please. I'm a Starfleet officer.

00:22:21.491 --> 00:22:23.624
You think I'd be into a guy
just because of his pheromones?

00:22:23.667 --> 00:22:26.104
Oh, thank God. I was worriedyou were gonna break up with me.

00:22:26.148 --> 00:22:28.542
Yeah, listen, Brad,
you're sweet,

00:22:28.585 --> 00:22:31.632
but right now, I need to put
all my energy into my job.

00:22:31.675 --> 00:22:33.503
Specifically, studying
this fascinating parasite.

00:22:33.547 --> 00:22:35.026
Lover! Lover!
Lover! Lover! Lover!

00:22:35.070 --> 00:22:36.463
-Lover! Lover! Lover! Lover!
-Mwah.

00:22:36.506 --> 00:22:37.551
-Lover! Lover! Lover! Lover!
-Aw.

00:22:37.594 --> 00:22:39.466
She didbreak up with me.

00:22:39.509 --> 00:22:40.858
Hey, you'll find someone
who loves you

00:22:40.902 --> 00:22:42.817
without a googa attached
to your skull.

00:22:42.860 --> 00:22:44.166
You're just saying that.

00:22:44.209 --> 00:22:46.081
No, I'm not.
You're a catch, man.

00:22:46.124 --> 00:22:48.605
-You're real.
-I amreal.

00:22:48.649 --> 00:22:51.173
Hey, Mare, see you next month
at the M'tari tournament?

00:22:51.216 --> 00:22:55.830
Oh, you know it, and I'll try
not to bring it downtown.

00:22:55.873 --> 00:22:58.267
-Oh, shut up.

00:22:58.310 --> 00:23:00.008
Wait. You guys made plans?

00:23:00.051 --> 00:23:01.488
We bonded
while you were knocked out.

00:23:01.531 --> 00:23:03.751
-Over what?
-Nothing. Just girl stuff.

00:23:03.794 --> 00:23:05.883
So you shook
a Lortian's egg sack?

00:23:05.927 --> 00:23:08.233
Wait, how did...?
Oh. Oh, no! Oh, no!

00:23:10.105 --> 00:23:11.672
Aah.

00:23:11.715 --> 00:23:13.195
The Cerritosmight be
falling apart,

00:23:13.238 --> 00:23:14.892
but it's nice to be back home.

00:23:14.936 --> 00:23:18.113
Yeah, I missed that smoky smell.

00:23:18.156 --> 00:23:20.507
So, uh, hey, um,
before we left the Vancouver,

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:23.771
I got you something.

00:23:23.814 --> 00:23:25.294
You shouldn't have!

00:23:25.337 --> 00:23:26.687
Well, I figured
the Cerritoscould use them

00:23:26.730 --> 00:23:28.036
-a lot more than...
-No, no, no.

00:23:28.079 --> 00:23:30.517
I mean, look,
I stole a bunch, too.

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:31.996
-Yup, this...

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:33.781
this is why we're friends.

00:23:33.824 --> 00:23:37.045
Captioned by
Media Access Group at WGBH
access.wgbh.org

00:25:07.352 --> 00:25:08.353
Chirp.
